sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Robot Application
    participant SDK as AsyncEonClient
    participant Sub as Subsystem Client (e.g. Events)
    participant Trans as Transport Layer (HTTP / WS)
    participant Gate as EON API Gateway / Core

    Note over App, Gate: 1. Client Initialization & Handshake
    App->>SDK: AsyncEonClient(base_url, credentials)
    App->>SDK: await client.connect()
    SDK->>Trans: Initialize Connection Pool / SSL Context
    Trans->>Gate: GET /api/v1/version (Compatibility Handshake)
    Gate-->>Trans: 200 OK {"api_version": "1.4.0", "min_client": "0.1.0"}
    Trans-->>SDK: Handshake Verified
    SDK-->>App: Connected (Ready)

    Note over App, Gate: 2. Synchronous / Asynchronous Subsystem Call
    App->>Sub: await client.events.publish(envelope)
    Sub->>Sub: Validate Pydantic Schema & Scopes
    Sub->>Trans: Send Request (POST /api/v1/events)
    alt Network Disruption / 503 Unavailable
        Trans-->>Trans: Intercept Error (Transient Fault)
        Trans->>Trans: Apply Full Jitter Exponential Backoff (Wait Δt)
        Trans->>Gate: Retry Request (Attempt 2)
    end
    Gate-->>Trans: 200 OK {"ack_id": "ack_89f1", "status": "DELIVERED"}
    Trans-->>Sub: Deserialize Response to EventAck
    Sub-->>App: Return EventAck

    Note over App, Gate: 3. Real-Time Event Subscription Stream
    App->>Sub: await client.events.subscribe(["eon.perception.*"])
    Sub->>Trans: Open WebSocket (WSS) + Topic Subscription
    Gate-->>Trans: 101 Switching Protocols
    loop Incoming Stream
        Gate-->>Trans: Push EventEnvelope Frame
        Trans-->>Sub: Parse Typed EventEnvelope
        Sub-->>App: Yield Event via AsyncIterator
    end

    Note over App, Gate: 4. Graceful Teardown
    App->>SDK: await client.close()
    SDK->>Trans: Drain Queues & Close Sockets
    Trans->>Gate: Close WS Connection (Code 1000 Normal Closure)
    Trans-->>SDK: Closed
    SDK-->>App: Teardown Complete
